  "body": "Four bedrooms, two levels and a private front courtyard. Residence 1 at Forty West brings together open-plan living, internal garaging and a warm interior palette at a St Heliers address.\r\n\r\nAsking $1,395,000 including GST. Freehold. 4 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, 2 levels and one internal garage. Approximate floor area: 131.46 m².\r\n\r\nSliding doors connect the living spaces to a paved front courtyard. The two-level layout offers four bedrooms and two bathrooms, plus a separate W/C and one internal garage. The outdoor space is to the front; this residence does not have a rear garden.\r\n\r\nHazel Oak joinery, Taj Mahal benchtops, brushed-copper accents and Bremworth wool carpet bring warmth and texture to the proposed interiors. Refer to the specifications for your selected residence.\r\n\r\nConstruction is underway. The latest November site update shows the frames and trusses complete. Target handover is 31 March 2027, subject to construction progress, approvals and titles.\r\n\r\nAsk about opportunities to personalise selected finishes, subject to construction stage, developer approval and any agreed costs.\r\n\r\nExplore the floor plan, specifications and construction updates using the website link supplied with this listing or enquire to arrange a private appointment with Fraser Meads.\r\n\r\nView the website for more information: https://fortywest.co.nz\r\n\r\nRenders are artist impressions. Planting is shown at indicative maturity and will take time to establish. Final design, finishes and dimensions are subject to the sale documents.",
